  "title": "Chewy Coconut Cookies",
  "description": "These coconut cookies made with flaked coconut, butter, and brown sugar are deliciously crisp and chewy. Plus, they take just 10 minutes to bake!",
  "authors": [
    "N Hoff"
  ],
